# GRID results with the AV-HuBERT encoder fine-tuned before feature extraction.
# Frozen-encoder results are in RESULTS. Test: unseen speakers s1 s2 s20 s22
# (23,910 words). All Kaldi rows: flat-start e2e
# chain, renorm + no-relu + CMVN, unless marked fMLLR/tri3b.

# ---- 2026-10-05/06: matched CTC recipe (run_lora_finetune.sh, run_lora_eval.sh) ----
# letter CTC head, 3k-update head-only phase, mean-face 96px ROIs + random 88 crop,
# held-out validation speakers s7 s30, frozen BatchNorm stats. LoRA on q/k/v/out/fc1/fc2.

# base, LoRA rank 32 (5.3M trainable), input/avhubert_base_ctc_lora.pt  [headline base]
%WER 6.77 [ 1618 / 23910, 21 ins, 57 del, 1540 sub ] finetune_lora/exp_base_ctc_lora/hyp_test.txt  # model decoding itself, greedy CTC, no grammar
%WER 6.69 [ 1599 / 23910, 0 ins, 0 del, 1599 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_lor8norelu_cmvn/decode/wer_10_0.5  # layer 8 features
%WER 6.30 [ 1507 / 23910, 0 ins, 0 del, 1507 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_lor10norelu_cmvn/decode/wer_11_1.0  # layer 10 features
%WER 6.06 [ 1450 / 23910, 0 ins, 0 del, 1450 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_lor12norelu_cmvn/decode/wer_11_1.0  # layer 12 features

# base, full fine-tune control (103M trainable), input/avhubert_base_ctc_full.pt
%WER 6.24 [ 1493 / 23910, 17 ins, 65 del, 1411 sub ] finetune_lora/exp_base_ctc_full/hyp_test.txt  # model decoding itself
%WER 5.66 [ 1353 / 23910, 0 ins, 0 del, 1353 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_ful10norelu_cmvn/decode/wer_11_1.0  # layer 10 features
%WER 7.25 [ 1734 / 23910, 0 ins, 0 del, 1734 sub ] exp/chain/e2e_tdnnf_ful12norelu_cmvn/decode/wer_12_0.0  # layer 12 features

