# ---- 2026-10-16: GRID test, all 4,000 clips (24,000 words) ----
# LM weight chosen on held-out dev speakers, not on GRID test. Base, layer 10
# through the e2e chain (+CMVN), chain seed 0, encoder fine-tune seed 1337.
# arm               seed  valid  GRID
# LoRA r32          1337  5.10   6.34   input/avhubert_base_ctc_lora.pt
# full fine-tune    1337  5.48   5.70   input/avhubert_base_ctc_full.pt
